@startuml
[*] --> User_Registration
User_Registration --> SignIn : successful registration
SignIn --> FacilityAccess : after signing in
FacilityAccess --> NewsReading : read news/expert content
NewsReading --> HealthInfo : check symptoms or fitness options
HealthInfo --> ContinueOrFinish : continue/session finish
ContinueOrFinish --> InsuranceProcessing : insurance for finance services
InsuranceProcessing --> PaymentCompletion : complete payment with insurance
PaymentCompletion --> PaymentSelection : select cash/insurance for purchases
PaymentSelection --> CashPaymentDetails : choose cash
CashPaymentDetails --> FeedbackCollection : after service completion
FeedbackCollection --> LogOut : end of session
LogOut --> [*]
@enduml
